doc:Factsarticle1_29 dcterms:abstract "A hybrid ensemble predictive maintenance framework combining ensemble classifiers and SHAP explainability trained on industrial multivariate time-series sensors (temperature, vibration, voltage, pressure). Data preprocessing includes redundancy removal, label encoding, and scaling. Models evaluated using accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score and confusion matrix; three ensemble classifiers reported 100 percent success in fault detection." .
